  "goodToKnow": "Die Entwässerung is drainage: die Entwässerung von Straßen, Feldern, Mooren. Most of Germany's moors were drained for farming, and drained peatlands now release several percent of the country's greenhouse gases, so rewetting (die Wiedervernässung) is a climate goal. Medically, entwässernd means diuretic. The opposite is die Bewässerung (irrigation). Plural: die Entwässerungen."
